 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()` (exported from `src/index.ts`) returns an in-memory service with
+`addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })`, `quote({ itemId, start, end })` and `book({ itemId, start, end })`.
+Money is integer euro cents, times are ISO-8601 UTC strings at midnight (`2027-06-01T00:00:00Z`), and `end` is
+the start of the day after the last rental day. The same item cannot be booked for overlapping periods.
+Cancellation is not implemented yet. Run the tests with `npm test` (Node 22.18 or later runs the TypeScript tests directly).
